================================================================================
8. SERVICIOS FLUTTER (lib/services/)
================================================================================

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
api_client.dart
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Cliente HTTP centralizado.
  BASE_URL = https://presupuestos-backend-h3l6.onrender.com
  TIMEOUT  = 55 segundos
  Metodos estaticos: get(), post(), put(), delete()
  Headers: Content-Type: application/json

!! ADVERTENCIA CRITICA !!
  Durante desarrollo local, si se cambia baseUrl a 'http://localhost:3002'
  para probar, SIEMPRE revertirlo a la URL de Render antes de:
    1. Generar el APK de produccion
    2. Hacer git push (para que Render use el codigo correcto)
  El APK con localhost no funciona en dispositivos reales.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
shared_budget_service.dart
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
CRUD completo de presupuestos compartidos.

Metodos:
  getAll(uid)                          → GET /shared-budgets
  getDetail(id, uid)                   → GET /shared-budgets/:id
  create(body)                         → POST /shared-budgets
  invite(budgetId, email, uid)         → POST /shared-budgets/:id/invitations
  getInvitations(uid)                  → GET /shared-budget-invitations
  acceptInvitation(token, uid, ingreso)→ POST /shared-budget-invitations/:token/accept
  rejectInvitation(token, uid)         → POST /shared-budget-invitations/:token/reject
  createExpense(budgetId, body)        → POST /shared-budgets/:id/expenses
  getExpenses(budgetId, uid)           → GET /shared-budgets/:id/expenses
  createSettlement(budgetId, body)     → POST /shared-budgets/:id/settlements
  getSettlements(budgetId, uid)        → GET /shared-budgets/:id/settlements
  deleteExpense(expenseId, uid)        → DELETE /shared-expenses/:id
  confirmarMiParte(expenseId, uid)     → POST /shared-expenses/:id/confirm-payment [NUEVO]
  requestDelete(budgetId, uid)         → POST /shared-budgets/:id/request-delete   [NUEVO]

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
auth_service.dart
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  signIn()        → abre selector de cuenta Google
  silentSignIn()  → recupera sesion sin UI
  signOut()       → cierra sesion + limpia cache Hive
  currentUser     → getter del usuario actual

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
cache_service.dart
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  init()           → abre box 'salarying_cache'
  set(key, data)   → guarda con timestamp
  get(key, maxAge) → retorna si edad < maxAge (default 24h)
  clearForUser(uid) → limpia datos del usuario al logout
  clear()          → limpia todo el cache

